WEBVTT

00:06:26.173 --> 00:06:30.136
Hope for a country with open wounds
that is struggling to heal.

00:06:30.177 --> 00:06:31.345
Thank you.

00:06:31.345 --> 00:06:34.265
(Applause)

00:06:40.688 --> 00:06:42.731
Shoham Arad: I have a couple of questions.

00:06:42.731 --> 00:06:44.817
I'm a little emotional,
it's not a big deal.

00:06:45.317 --> 00:06:47.570
You've gone back
to Afghanistan since you left.

00:06:48.195 --> 00:06:50.406
Can you tell us
what it feels like right now?

00:06:50.448 --> 00:06:52.491
Kiana Hayeri: The situation is very grim.

00:06:53.909 --> 00:06:56.412
I guess war has ended, but at a cost.

00:06:56.954 --> 00:06:59.248
But poverty is shooting out the roof,

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:00.624
people are hungry,